Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:03.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快抱着你弟弟跑出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 Dean 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Dean, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我那时候也小 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.I was a kid, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最重要的是 - 照顾好Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Most important - Watch out for Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我生命中的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this brother, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he always tell me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会好好照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna watch our for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃晚饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, eat your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get your vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么敢想 我会把任何别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare think that there's anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得比你更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I would put in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sammy受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤的很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我治疗Sam的同时 也在治疗我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heal Sam while I healing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每用一下我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I use my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己身体状况就会减弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It weakens me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经历了试炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是觉得 你最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think it's better if.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took it easy, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么精力旺盛 就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And didn't act like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被天使附身了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessed by an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.71,0:00:41.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.69,0:00:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:58.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赫利威尔 纽约州）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快 赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.Come on.Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.28,0:01:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去 关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.Close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.11,0:01:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了好吗 说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys.The barn is a.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,仓库不是捉迷藏的范围啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A no-fly zone during hide-and-go seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小屁孩儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来 小坏蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you delinquents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.31,0:01:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 游戏结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.Game's over, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,10分钟前就熄灯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out was 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一帮小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我数到10\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got till the count of 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.65,0:02:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好全出来 不然叫你们好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'd better come out or the beIt's coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.42,0:02:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,1\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点都不好玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识 不认识什么D犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no…There's no D-Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny 嘿 有事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, hey, so what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你小心些\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, yeah, just sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:03:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 D犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was that all about, D-Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记不记得 很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一年春天我们在纽约州的北边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That spring in Upstate, New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸去猎食人怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was on a rugaru hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 我们住进了一个租来的小房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We…we crashed the bungalow colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面只有乒乓球桌 - 记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With the ping pong table - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得后来你不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来的时候你就没影儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came back you were gone and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后老爸把我送去Bobby家待了好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shift me off to Bobby's for a couple of months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找你找了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And went and found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是什么在一次猎魔中失踪了之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were lost in a hunt or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们是这么跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we told you.Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 什么叫这么跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.That's what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸留下的饭钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost food money that dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打牌输光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left for us in a card game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道等你饿了的时候就没办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd get hungry so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就想从当地一个市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to take in the 5 finger discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺手牵牵羊 但是被发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At local market and got busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.62,0:04:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是去猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't on a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被送去一个少年之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent me to a boy's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,少年之家吗 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy's home?Like a.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,少管所一类的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reform school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个农场 负责人是Sonny\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a farm and a guy ran it, Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 他很照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…He looked after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 Sonny知道我们是干什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, does Sonny know what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他人不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我把备用手机的手机号给他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave hime the number of bat phone and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:04:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似他现在遇到我们管的事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like he's got something on our wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这次自己行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you're gonna be cool to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你太累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you get too tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 嗯 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…yeah, I'm just.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家对去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everybody's okay with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡茨斯基都没意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading out to the Catskill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿就我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾好自己的行李 准备出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your stuff.We'll head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么当时 你不直接说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去了少年之家 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You went to a boy's home - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.25,0:05:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老爸编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dad's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it just.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事就变成那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…story became the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时候才16岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,待了两个月 老爸都没找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 2 months, and dad couldn't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 他找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, he found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.45,0:06:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快就找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found me quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他把我扔这儿了 因为我把钱输光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he left me here, cause I lost the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才16 16的孩子都会犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were 16 and you made mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是我犯的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I made the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟老爸没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this was dad's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我弟弟 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是Sonny的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're old buddies of Sonny's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,狱友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉他我们到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind telling him we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,地是刚拖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just mop this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,脏鞋什么的都不许踩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take off those road stunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有前科\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's an ex-con.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然呢 善良的天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he would?Such an angel.
