Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else about that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能记得什么 任何事情都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you can remember, anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got really cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不赶紧完成我的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to finish my chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruth太太会很生气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before Mrs.Ruth gets mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruth管的很严吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Ruth, she runs a tight ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶紧回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'd better roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这个镇子里长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew up in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:14:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候经常来这个农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to come up here as a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wasserlaufs一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wasserlaufs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Howard和Doreen\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard and Doreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾经是这儿的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used to own this farm back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的同事Jack\N{\fnArial\fs30}My coworker Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}May he rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这儿的农场工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked here as a farm hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Howard是个好人 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard was a nice man but.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在他酗酒之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when he didn't get into that corn liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天他神经质的坚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night he got into his thick skull that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack跟他老婆Doreen上床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack and his wife Dereine were rolling around in the hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这当然不是真的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't true but.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Howard太多疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard is paranoid's got the better of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试图杀了他们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack逃走了 但是Doreen\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack got away but Doreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一根铁钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the meat cliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被判进了监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got life in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但Howard在一年前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which for Howard ended a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是发誓一定要找Jack报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always swore he'd get his revenge on poor Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他得手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he finally got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Howard的尸体埋在镇子里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Howard buried here in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸不想让你告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad didn't want you to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方真的那么不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this place really so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不怎么记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人对我动手动脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody bad touched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人用烟头烫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody burned me with their smokes or.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者用衣架抽我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat me with a metal hanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没什么不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call that a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 咱们该把这家伙送西天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's barbecue old McDonald here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,早烧早超生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell outta dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cus餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cus's Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 你知道 我完全可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know I'm fine just.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿了汉堡去别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a burger and to go somewhere right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要一份史上最美味的香蕉薄饼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?Miss the best banana pancakes you ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要来这儿超过几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only these for the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都带他们来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}After they've been here for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说谢谢你帮我撤销控诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant for getting the charges against me dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿肚子不犯法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, being hunger is not a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但偷东西就犯法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stealing that is but.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你日后不再犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel if you only do that once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要留下案底\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deserve a record.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于我们没法联系到你老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since we can't find your pops anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以想住多久住多久 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay here as long as you want, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在学校表现很出色 交到了新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing good in school, you making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还加入了摔跤队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made the wrestling team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你几件事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能对我有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you into thie whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴暗的恶魔崇拜思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy metal devil worship stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.21,0:19:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是 我不是有偏见什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not-I'm not judging.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.03,0:19:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just I found a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的床柱上刻着几个标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occult-looking symbols carving in your bedpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a very long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.01,0:19:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这个故事能解释为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this story have anything to do why you put salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚睡觉前 你都会在房间门口撒盐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In front of your bunk door every night before bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的家务事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a family thing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想多说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't really talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个把你扔在这儿的那个家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same family that left you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are-what are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思说还是别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a mob or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前是个混帮派的 记得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was part of this gang, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活的很自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们的帮派 我甚至可以去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've been died for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道最后怎么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在监狱待了15年\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 years in a correctional facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对谁忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}To who.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该忠诚于自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've been loyal to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 因为如果真的有变节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you get one shot in this game, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你照镜子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you look into the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望镜子里的人 不是别人 就是自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the guy to look back at you to be his own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Robin 你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Robin, how are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, how are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,来见见我农场的小工头 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet my new ranch foreman here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Robin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到Cus餐馆 两位想来点儿什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Cus's, what can I get you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你一定没想到能在这儿见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you never thought you'd see me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.19,0:20:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有点儿忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm a little bit of slammed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不来点儿今日特供吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't yu guys here for the specials.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Robin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在Sonny那儿的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to live up at Sonny's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.77,0:20:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, sorry there's just.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在Sonny那儿住过的孩子太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so many boys that passed through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能记住所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to remember every.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人和名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every name and face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.71,0:20:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.71,0:20:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sorry, I just have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你跟你妈妈经常去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember you coming up there with your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.23,0:20:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她教孩子们弹吉他 很久以前的事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd give guitar lesson that's a long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是喜欢帮助那些男孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loved helping out the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.53,0:20:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去世之后 我接替了她的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept giving lessons after she passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Robin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you excuse me, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥们儿 - 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.82,0:21:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 绝对有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously, there was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女招待是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it was nothing, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.28,0:21:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再提了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想冲进去救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to get in and save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但该死的 那门就是打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the damn door wouldn't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,农场里的门根本没有装锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no locks on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means our little field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the cemetery was a bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny 你能想起不对劲的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny is there anything else weird you could remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 都这样了难道还有更不对劲的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?'Cause we're not chest-deep in weird already, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 我明白 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何细节都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.54,0:21:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ruth总是带着她的念珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruth always had her rosery beads with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我现在找不到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I can't find them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们从受害者开始分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with the vics, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都住在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean they both lived in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,平时都跟这群男孩子们走得很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both worked close with the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我去找他们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I go can have a chat with the rug rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.17,0:21:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny 你有被害员工的个人记录吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny, you got any employee records of the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My office.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, what you gonna do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要开始哭了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.09,0:22:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy你个小怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy you're such a little weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.55,0:22:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.78,0:22:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.95,0:22:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.61,0:22:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.34,0:22:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.47,0:22:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早晨Ruth出事儿的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Ruth had her accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.12,0:22:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们不用告诉你任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to tell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.15,0:22:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早上根本不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't even here this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny让我们去城里买鸡饲料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny sent us to town to get some chicken feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那Ruth呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Ruth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.53,0:22:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you tell me about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.38,0:22:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都管她叫戒律长\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to call her the warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.08,0:22:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是拿圣经说事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a real bible-thumping hard-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.27,0:22:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不同寻常或者奇怪的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything different or weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.99,0:22:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有想起来什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是问 除了怪胎Timmy之外的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, besides Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.63,0:22:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:22:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩谁要是敢再动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either of you touch him ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.82,0:23:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就对你们俩不客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go all Guantanamo on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.97,0:23:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在赶紧给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.17,0:23:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和Bruce都没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Bruce okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.75,0:23:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种人其实都是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys like that they are cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.16,0:23:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.47,0:23:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要反击一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is stand up to'em one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就再也不敢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.65,0:23:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Sonny 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sonny, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.84,0:23:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我们的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all our hall of fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.18,0:23:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这儿的 有很多都是很出色的运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had some pretty great athletes come through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他赢了61公斤级摔跤比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was Sullivan county in 135 pound wrestling champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随时都能泡上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can give me lessens any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.74,0:24:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她太老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.She's like ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.19,0:24:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿怎么跑到这里面去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this doing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子估计得缝上8000针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's gonna need 8000 stiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.06,0:25:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是还能喘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.56,0:25:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子之前在欺负Timmy 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid was bullying Timmy before the accident, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.79,0:25:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.96,0:25:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy是在一座废弃的房子里被发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy was found in an abbandoned building.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.70,0:25:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概一年前 只有他一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a year ago by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.15,0:25:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道他在那里待了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one was sure how long he'd been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.54,0:25:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父母呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时在网上发了照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}They posted a pictures on the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.09,0:25:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁都没出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one ever showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.53,0:25:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他为什么在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what's he doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.11,0:25:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不应该去孤儿院之类的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't he be in like an orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.28,0:25:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直从儿童服务中心逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept running away from child services.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.90,0:25:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概在3个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So about 3 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.91,0:25:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny才把他带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny offered to take him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.15,0:25:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 惹人厌的管理员\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so hard-ass counselors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.83,0:25:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺负人的坏孩子都成了受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullies all bite to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.26,0:25:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但Timmy还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Timmy's standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.61,0:25:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那咱们要找的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.14,0:25:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只愤怒的Damian吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got ourselves a Damian on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 EMF的数据显示不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, EMF rules out a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.90,0:26:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能是鬼魂附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably ghost possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.89,0:26:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接一把盐灌Timmy嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find Timmy and shove a fistful of.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.19,0:26:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,强迫鬼魂离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt down his throat, forced ejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.72,0:26:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次换你去检查仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking the barn this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.99,0:27:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你去过很多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've been to a lot of places.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, My.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.32,0:27:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸喜欢游荡四方\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad likes to move around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.94,0:28:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What your dad do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很无聊的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.13,0:28:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.99,0:28:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.27,0:28:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我爸想让我接管他的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my dad expects me to follow his footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.55,0:28:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我已经习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…I've kinda gotten used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.53,0:28:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.70,0:28:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸也让我接管餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pops wants me to take over the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.66,0:28:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 是不会成真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.77,0:28:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you really want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.41,0:28:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想当摄影师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be a photographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.95,0:28:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起周游世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.61,0:28:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去一些很稀奇的地方 品尝各种食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to strange lands, eat crazy food.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.46,0:28:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想当摇滚明星 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be a rock star, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很喜欢车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also really like cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.36,0:28:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械工似乎很辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a mechanic seems rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.24,0:28:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 才不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?No, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.37,0:28:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的汽车都非常酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cars are freaking cool as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.02,0:28:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,修理他们就像解谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fixing them is like a puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.70,0:28:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 最酷的地方就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the best part is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.82,0:28:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你修完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.47,0:29:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就走了 你不需要负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}They leave, you're not responsible for them any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.83,0:29:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲过女生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you kissed many girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.71,0:29:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 当然 亲过很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?Yeah, of course.Lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.76,0:29:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.56,0:29:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来 我们需要更多的练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we'll just have to keep practising.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.07,0:29:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在餐厅的时候你们怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happen to you at the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.06,0:29:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚要回头给你们点菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned around to take your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.17,0:29:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.98,0:29:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.70,0:29:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见Timmy了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.15,0:29:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.50,0:29:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他应该马上就来上吉他课了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he should be here any minute for his guitar lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.55,0:29:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但是他的课得取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're gonna cancel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.78,0:29:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.80,0:29:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就要离开市里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of there, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.71,0:29:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间给你解释 你只需要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time to explain.You just gotta trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.70,0:29:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我还要再相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would I do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.04,0:30:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的确记得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.03,0:30:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.94,0:30:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.18,0:30:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能永远这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope this lasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 就听你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.53,0:30:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.44,0:30:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不谁带你去学校的舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else will take you to the school dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.69,0:30:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你在邀请我当你的舞伴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your way of asking me to be your date.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我的表现怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how am I doing so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.16,0:30:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是逼不得已才走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were reasons why I had to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.57,0:30:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我没时间解释给你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time to explain them to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.04,0:30:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得带你马上离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.27,0:31:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.40,0:31:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.48,0:31:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about what Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.87,0:31:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我停不下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.86,0:31:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.53,0:31:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁住了 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked.Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.41,0:31:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,画圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.81,0:31:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 刚才发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what just happened in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.21,0:31:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.76,0:31:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么 你都待在这个圈里面不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, you stay inside of this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.92,0:31:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了么 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understood - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.68,0:31:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.65,0:31:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't control her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.67,0:31:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你控制不了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't control who.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.50,0:31:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.47,0:31:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.05,0:31:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们讲讲那场火的事情 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you tell us about the fire, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.03,0:32:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时很晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was late.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.10,0:32:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开车回家路上撞进了树丛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were driving home when we crashed in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.12,0:32:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围所有东西都着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was on fire, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.87,0:32:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.07,0:32:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我推出车外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pushed me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.87,0:32:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后她和车一起爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the car blew up with her in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.74,0:32:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这不是故事的全部 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not all, was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.44,0:32:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑进树丛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran through the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.84,0:32:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了个闲置的房子 就躲了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And found an empty building where I hid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.65,0:32:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕 周围又冷又黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared.It was dark and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.04,0:32:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.04,0:32:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭喊着我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cried for my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.88,0:32:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她就出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, she came.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.89,0:32:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她变了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she changed, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.36,0:32:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是她给你的那个玩偶对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet she gave you that cool action figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.06,0:32:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我九岁生日的时候给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when I turned nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.55,0:33:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy 把那个玩偶给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, I'm gonna need that action figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.70,0:33:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.90,0:33:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我铲除邪恶势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I clobber evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.60,0:33:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来并不是这个玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks it wasn't the action figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.77,0:33:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,牵扯着她留在这里不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was anchoring her here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.08,0:33:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.99,0:33:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.56,0:33:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.96,0:34:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他母亲不走或许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe his mom can't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在另一个世界保护着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she is still protecting him from the grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.84,0:34:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他远离什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protecting him from what?From us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.94,0:34:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她分不清楚什么是真的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she doesn't know what threats are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.39,0:34:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是假的 所以攻击一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's not, so she just attacks all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.45,0:34:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.35,0:34:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 除了杀了他就再没别的办法了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?unless we waste the kid, we are sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.95,0:34:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.98,0:34:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Robin Robin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robin, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.05,0:34:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.25,0:34:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Robin等等 - 你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Robin, wait - Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.07,0:34:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在唯一的任务就是保证你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now the only thing is keeping you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.34,0:34:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy 我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, we're gonna need your help okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.10,0:34:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我希望你集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, I need you to focus, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.99,0:34:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look we are not here to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.23,0:34:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.39,0:35:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我阻止不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.78,0:35:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy 你必须阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, you have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.80,0:35:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你哭喊她 她才出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came to you when you cried out for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.65,0:35:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要告诉她离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have to tell her to stop and go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.11,0:35:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是我妈 - 她是个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is my mom - She is a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.49,0:35:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy 因为她放不下你 现在成疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, because she can't move on, she is going crazy.OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.48,0:35:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.13,0:35:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.93,0:35:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.48,0:35:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时为了保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you gotta do what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.53,0:35:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害自己爱的人 也是在所难免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it's gonna hurt the one you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.57,0:35:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 停止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.69,0:35:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy 再加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, Kung Fu grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.49,0:35:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 住手吧 别再伤害别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy stop it.Stop hurting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.38,0:36:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须离开 永远不要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to go, never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.21,0:36:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be OK, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.97,0:36:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.68,0:37:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这就是所谓的家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then, this is the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.11,0:37:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就告诉你了 无聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it was boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.33,0:37:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.78,0:37:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.51,0:37:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开之后并没有成为摇滚明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not run off to become a rock star.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.88,0:37:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.60,0:37:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你现在酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look pretty rocking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.56,0:37:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.09,0:37:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.40,0:37:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我会厌烦小镇里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought I would hate being in the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.21,0:37:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,千篇一律的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little town my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.97,0:37:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如接管过生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, taking over the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.19,0:37:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我爸希望的那样 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like dad always wanted, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.62,0:37:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有厌烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.15,0:37:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实挺喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.32,0:37:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 在我们16岁时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we didn't know everything we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.50,0:37:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不像自己想的那么了解自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did when we were 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.72,0:37:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是完全不了解 只有一些小偏差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything.Just some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.41,0:38:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来Timmy需要一点帮助来过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like Timmy's gonna need some help adjusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.97,0:38:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he's got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.81,0:38:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还像原来一样 讨厌看你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always hate to see you go, D dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't thank you enough for this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.13,0:38:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny we will see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.61,0:38:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can bet on that boys.Take it easy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.78,0:38:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how do you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.78,0:38:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让Timmy要求他妈走 会有用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy asking his mom to leave is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.87,0:38:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 纯属巧合 好运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.Total Hail Mary.Got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.94,0:38:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运气而已吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.32,0:38:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你在这个地方一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda like what you do with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.50,0:38:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这里是你生命里最糟糕的一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean here I was thinking this is the worst part.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.20,0:38:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of your life and it turns out to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.33,0:38:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you ever leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.47,0:38:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never felt right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.69,0:38:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.98,0:38:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就两个月 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was two months, Sam.OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.19,0:38:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直等不急离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't wait to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.27,0:38:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要怎么跟你说 那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to tell you.It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.23,0:39:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.34,0:39:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整的挺干净啊 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You clean up good - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.62,0:39:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.78,0:39:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前从没去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never actually been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.89,0:39:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种学校舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of those school dances before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.47,0:39:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这个 你爸在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, about that, Dean, your old man is outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.04,0:39:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人还真是摸不透\N{\fnArial\fs30}And man he is really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.38,0:39:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.37,0:39:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚对你很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a big night it was for you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.54,0:39:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还问他能不能晚点再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then ask him if he could come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.94,0:39:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他说只要跟你说 有活儿干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he just said to tell you that he had the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.95,0:39:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会懂是什么意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said you'd know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.88,0:40:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我出狱后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I got out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.44,0:40:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方给了我第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place gave me a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.82,0:40:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来也给了你同样的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's done the same for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.38,0:40:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 只要你愿意 我会帮你帮到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you want, I'll stick my neck out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.38,0:40:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你争取留下来的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fight for you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.16,0:40:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sonny\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.49,0:40:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.41,0:41:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我还是要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.47,0:41:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.89,0:41:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.80,0:41:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.83,0:41:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在我身边照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For always being there for having my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.08,0:41:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一路走来不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look the way it hasn't always been easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.08,0:41:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真搞不清楚你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell you are talking about.
